# Copy to frontend/.env.local for local overrides, or set as a Vercel
# project environment variable for production. Leave unset for local dev --
# Vite's dev server proxy (see vite.config.ts) already forwards same-origin
# "/api" calls to http://127.0.0.1:8000, so nothing needs to be set there.

# The backend's own origin, no trailing slash and no "/api" suffix, e.g.:
#   VITE_API_BASE=https://reno-backend.duckdns.org
# Required once the frontend and backend are deployed on different origins
# (e.g. frontend on Vercel, backend on a separate host) -- otherwise every
# API call and image fetch resolves against the frontend's own origin and
# 404s.
VITE_API_BASE=
